<text x="2" y="118" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">Pi Wall Socket rev A — 180 x 120 mm, 2 layers, 1.6 mm FR-4</text>
<text x="2" y="115.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">MAINS: L → F1 → PS1.2 and U3.16/17 ; N → PS1.1 and U3.15 ; MOV1 after F1</text>
<text x="72" y="118" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">HAZARDOUS VOLTAGE — 8.0 mm creepage / 6.5 mm clearance to all SELV copper</text>
<text x="72" y="115.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">Creepage figure from PLC Stamp mini 2 datasheet §8.3 (4000 Vac isolation)</text>
<text x="2" y="32" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">U3 pads 15/16/17 are mains: keep this corner free of every other pad</text>
<text x="84" y="52" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W: 65 x 30 mm module, four M2.5 holes at 58 x 23 mm</text>
<text x="150" y="14" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">U4 RJ45 nose overhangs the right edge</text>
